      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-14T06:05:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.   That does mean that `KESignature` is implicitly only for a signed session ID, not for any other signed data.  If that\u0027s so, should we rename it to `SessionIdSignature` or somesuch?",
      "parentUuid": "3eaba24d_f9f0266d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 18,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "68aaa9f9fe7b872fa851c08a16e5c63f0d06c7db",
