      "writtenOn": "2023-09-14T16:47:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t see that part. I read the section on: `Ephemeral-Static or Static-Static`. It seems like the two texts suggest two different things. But since the text you copied explicitly mentions that we can use static-static, let\u0027s stick with that. Thanks!",
